Package: agent-token-saver
Version: 0.2.0
Section: python
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-click, python3-rich, python3-tiktoken, python3-yaml
Maintainer: agent-token-saver contributors <https://github.com/MQ-HZY-For-Cute/agent-token-saver>
Homepage: https://github.com/MQ-HZY-For-Cute/agent-token-saver
Description: AI Coding Agent Token Saver
  Reduces token consumption across multiple AI coding agents (Claude Code,
  Codex, OpenClaw, Cursor, Aider, Continue, Windsurf) via four strategies:
  .
   - Input compression (strip comments, docstrings, skeleton extraction)
   - Content deduplication (hash-based, SimHash fuzzy matching)
   - Output minimization (truncation, field omission, compression)
   - Incremental context (changed files only, path abbreviation)
  .
  Provides CLI commands for preprocessing (ats prep), multi-agent adapter
  management (ats agents), hook management (ats hooks), session tracking
  (ats sessions), analytics (ats stats), daemon monitoring (ats daemon),
  and a real-time TUI dashboard (ats tui).
  .
  Also supports NPX execution: npx agent-token-saver <command>
